&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.pydantic.dev/contributing/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Contributing to Pydantic&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;reporting-a-security-vulnerability&#34;&gt;Reporting a Security Vulnerability
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;See our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic/security/policy&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;security policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
